Package: SCJ
Type: Package
Title: Single Case Jamovi (SCJ)
Version: 1.0.0
Author:
  - Michela Possenti (ORCID - 0000-0001-8937-0611)
  - Renato Orti (ORCID - 0000-0002-6856-7981)
Maintainer:
  Renato Orti <renato.orti@unipd.it>
Description:
    Single Case Jamovi (SCJ) is a Jamovi module for clinical
    and experimental neuropsychology. It implements Frequentist
    and Bayesian statistical methods (based on Crawford & Garthwaite's
    methodology) to reliably compare single-case scores against 
    small normative samples, utilizing the singcar R package.
